<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-5">
  <div class="col-8 offset-2">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Letter from Our Founders</h1>
    
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="text-center mb-4">
          <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150x150" class="rounded-circle mb-3" alt="Founders">
          <h5>Rahul Sharma & Priya Patel</h5>
          <p class="text-muted">Co-founders, BnBharat</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="letter-content">
          <p class="lead">Dear BnBharat Community,</p>
          
          <p>
            When we started BnBharat in 2025, we had a simple yet ambitious vision: to create a platform 
            that would showcase the incredible diversity and hospitality that India has to offer, while 
            empowering local communities to benefit from tourism.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Growing up in different parts of India, we both experienced the warmth of Indian hospitality 
            firsthand. Whether it was staying with relatives in small towns or being welcomed by strangers 
            during our travels, we realized that the true essence of travel lies in authentic connections 
            with local people and places.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Today, BnBharat has grown beyond our wildest dreams. We have thousands of hosts across the 
            country, from bustling metros to serene hill stations, from heritage havelis in Rajasthan 
            to houseboats in Kerala. Each property tells a unique story, and every host contributes to 
            the rich tapestry of experiences we offer.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            But our journey is far from over. We're constantly working to improve our platform, enhance 
            safety measures, and create new opportunities for our community. We're investing in technology 
            that makes hosting easier and travel more seamless, while never losing sight of the human 
            connections that make travel meaningful.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            We're also committed to responsible tourism. Through our partnerships with local organizations 
            and our sustainability initiatives, we're working to ensure that tourism benefits local 
            communities while preserving the natural and cultural heritage of our destinations.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            As we look to the future, we're excited about the possibilities ahead. We're expanding to new 
            destinations, launching innovative features, and building partnerships that will create even 
            more value for our community.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Thank you for being part of the BnBharat family. Whether you're a host opening your doors to 
            travelers or a guest exploring new places, you're helping us build something truly special. 
            Together, we're not just changing how people travel – we're creating a more connected, 
            understanding, and compassionate world.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Here's to many more adventures together!
          </p>
          
          <div class="mt-4">
            <p class="mb-1"><strong>Rahul Sharma</strong></p>
            <p class="text-muted small">Co-founder & CEO</p>
            
            <p class="mb-1 mt-3"><strong>Priya Patel</strong></p>
            <p class="text-muted small">Co-founder & CTO</p>
          </div>
          
          <hr class="my-4">
          
          <p class="text-muted small">
            <em>This letter was last updated in January 2025. For the latest updates from our founders, 
            follow us on social media or subscribe to our newsletter.</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>